 "query": "I spent the weekend at my friend's cabin upstate, and we picked so many wild blueberries that I ended up making three batches of jam and a blueberry crumble that turned out so good even my picky cousin went back for thirds. We also took the kayak out on the lake early on Saturday morning and saw a family of loons with two tiny fluffy babies swimming right next to us, it was such a sweet moment. Oh, and my neighbor's golden retriever had puppies last week, I went over to see them yesterday and they're all so soft and wiggly I almost asked if I could bring one home. \n\nAnyway, I need to make a couple adjustments to my pending orders. First, for order #W4219264, could you update the shipping address to 144 Lakeview Drive, Suite 925, New York, NY 10228, USA? Also for that same order, swap item 8886009523 for item 2407258246, and charge the difference to credit_card_1620755. Then for order #W6729841, swap item 3076708684 for item 8302289002, and charge that difference to credit_card_1620755 as well, thanks.",
